UI overhaul changes (Iteration 3):
- Design system: colors.xml (bg_primary #F8F6F2, bg_surface #FFFFFF, text_primary #171717,
  text_secondary #77736E, accent_primary #C62828, accent_gold #D6A84F, success #36845B,
  border #E9E5DF, hanzi #171717, pinyin #77736E); dimens.xml spacing tokens; themes.xml light theme
- MainActivity: single-activity container with bottom nav bar (5 tabs), view switching
- HomeScreen: dashboard — greeting, progress card (lessons done, words total, progress bar),
  Continue learning button, HSK course cards
- LearnScreen: HSK course lesson cards with done/available states, tap to open lesson
- LessonScreen: hanzi (64sp focal), pinyin beneath, meaning tap-to-reveal, progress bar,
  prev/next navigation, mark-lesson-done with persistence
- VocabScreen: searchable vocabulary library with HSK level tags
- ReviewScreen: marked review words list
- ProfileScreen: avatar, learner identity, stats
- Removed dead code: LessonActivity, CardActivity, FlipCardView, PathViews, old layout XMLs

Fixes applied during build (Iteration 0-3):
- aapt2 compile/link: pass individual files, not directories
- activity_card/lesson/main.xml: removed (replaced by programmatic views, old color refs)
- ic_launcher_circle.xml: encoding="utf-8"
- FlipCardView: custom Animation with Camera (Rotate3dAnimation not in SDK)
- Activities: android.app.Activity (no androidx/Gradle)
- d8: pass individual .class files, not directories
- Kotlin stdlib: bundled in DEX (was missing → instant crash on open)
- uses-sdk: minSdkVersion=21 / targetSdkVersion=34 (was missing → "not compatible")
- LinearLayout.LayoutParams.weight used instead of View.weight

Root cause of instant crash: Kotlin standard library was compiled against but not bundled in the APK.
Every Kotlin class (data classes, listOf, object HskData) threw NoClassDefFoundError at runtime.
Fixed by adding build/kotlin-stdlib-2.4.21.jar to d8 input. DEX grew 49KB → 2.3MB.

